---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, fullAddress } from '../data/site';
const updated = '21 November 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.legalName} collects and uses personal data submitted through this website.`}>
  <section class="about-hero"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p class="tagline">Last updated: {updated}</p></section>
  <section class="about-section prose">
    <p>This policy explains how {site.legalName} ("we", "us") handles personal data collected through {site.url}. It is written to follow India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you send a message or quote request, we collect the details you enter: your name, company, email address, phone number, the product you are interested in and your message. We do not collect payment information on this website.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2>
    <p>We use these details only to reply to your enquiry, prepare quotations and, if you become a customer, to fulfil your orders. We do not sell or rent your personal data.</p>
    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>Your message is delivered by email to our sales team. Our web host and email provider process the data on our behalf to make this possible.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep enquiry emails for as long as needed to respond and to maintain business records, and delete them when no longer required.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics, a service of Google, to understand how visitors use this website: which pages are visited, how people arrive here (for example from a search engine), the type of device and browser, the approximate location (city or country) and whether a visitor sends an enquiry or taps our phone, WhatsApp or email links. Google Analytics sets cookies (named <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_…</code>) in your browser to tell visits apart. It does not tell us who you are, and we do not combine it with the details you send in an enquiry.</p>
    <p>We use this information only to improve the website and our service. We do not use advertising cookies, do not use it to show you adverts and do not sell it. Google processes the data on our behalf and may store it on servers outside India; see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. Analytics data is kept for 14 months.</p>
    <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or stop Google Analytics on all websites with Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">opt-out browser add-on</a>. The website works the same without them.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the personal data we hold about you, or withdraw your consent, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{site.legalName}, {fullAddress}. Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
